              {
                "id": "u_content_greeting",
                "type": "text",
                "values": {
                  "containerPadding": "6px 36px 16px 36px",
                  "anchor": "",
                  "fontSize": "15px",
                  "color": "#334155",
                  "textAlign": "left",
                  "lineHeight": "165%",
                  "linkStyle": {
                    "inherit": true,
                    "linkColor": "#0000ee",
                    "linkHoverColor": "#0000ee",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "hideDesktop": false,
                  "displayCondition": null,
                  "_styleGuide": null,
                  "_meta": {
                    "htmlID": "u_content_text_3",
                    "htmlClassNames": "u_content_text"
                  },
                  "selectable": true,
                  "draggable": true,
                  "duplicatable": true,
                  "deletable": true,
                  "hideable": true,
                  "locked": false,
                  "text": "<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;\">Dear <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;\">On behalf of the entire GDG AJCE community, it is with immense pleasure that we extend our warmest welcome to you as a newly selected member of our Executive Committee. Your dedication, passion, and vision for fostering a vibrant developer community truly stood out, and we are excited to have you join us. Specifically, your selection for the '{{team}}' role is a testament to your potential and commitment.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;\">This is an exciting moment to contribute actively to shaping the future of technology and innovation at Amal Jyothi College of Engineering. As an Excecom member, you will play a pivotal role in organizing impactful events, workshops, and initiatives that empower fellow students and developers. You will collaborate with a diverse team of enthusiastic peers and mentors, gaining invaluable leadership, technical, and organizational experience.</p><p style=\"margin:0;\">To ensure you're fully integrated and receive all essential updates, we urge you to join our official GDG AJCE Excecom WhatsApp group immediately. This will be our primary channel for real-time communication, planning, and coordination. We look forward to your active participation and fresh perspectives as we embark on this exciting journey together!</p>"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "u_content_action_buttons",
                "type": "html",
                "values": {
                  "html": "<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/Ftflnf70DRrAXIhwWJQ2Bo\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; display:inline-block; text-decoration:none; background-color:#25D366; color:#ffffff; border-radius:28px; padding:13px 24px; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; margin:6px; box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(37,211,102,0.35); text-align:center; border:1px solid #1ebe5d;\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"display:inline-table; vertical-align:middle;\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:middle; padding-right:10px;\"><img src=\"https://gdgajce.vercel.app/assets/whatsapp-icon.png\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" alt=\"WhatsApp\" style=\"display:block; width:22px; height:22px; border:0;\" /></td><td style=\"vertical-align:middle; color:#ffffff; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; line-height:1;\">Join Excecom WhatsApp Group</td></tr></table></a></div>",
                  "hideDesktop": false,
                  "displayCondition": null,
                  "_styleGuide": null,
                  "containerPadding": "6px 36px 26px 36px",
                  "anchor": "",
                  "_meta": {
                    "htmlID": "u_content_html_4",
